cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below."
title: "Scientific Question Backtesting Benchmark"
abstract: >
  An open protocol and pilot benchmark for historically evaluating
  AI-generated scientific questions: questions are frozen against
  literature available before a historical cutoff and evaluated against
  a temporally isolated future corpus.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
version: 1.0.0
